      en: ["The lake covers an area of approximately 22 km².", "It is the fourth largest artificial lake in France.", "The village of Les Salles-sur-Verdon was flooded in 1974.", "The dam stands at a height of 95 meters.", "The total water volume is 761 million cubic meters.", "It marks the southern end of the Verdon Gorge."],
